WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.760
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: When it comes to cross-testing

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.760
SCPs, “Why Not?”

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.180
Is NOT an excuse!

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.940
Cross-testing SCPs is a rigorous process,
not to be taken lightly.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.000
It comes with a variety of risks that could
jeopardize the safety of all involved if the

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.110
wrong anomalies are put in a room together.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:23.940
So, while it may be his favorite Hilary Duff
song, “why not” just won’t do when it

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.420
comes to experimentation.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:31.090
This especially goes for putting anything
in a room with SCP-682.

